    {
      "id": 387951885,
      "slug": "thesmarter-tafqeet-2-1",
      "org": "thesmarter",
      "repo": "Tafqeet",
      "full_name": "thesmarter/Tafqeet",
      "tag_name": "2.1",
      "name": "Php Tafqeet v2.1",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/thesmarter/Tafqeet/releases/tag/2.1",
      "author": {
        "login": "Tayeb-Ali",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9208109?v=4",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/Tayeb-Ali"
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-13T15:59:31Z",
      "published_at": "2026-09-13T16:01:04Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-13T16:01:04Z",
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "### 🎉 What's New in v2.1\r\n\r\n#### 💱 New: Expanded Currency Support\r\nAdded **16 new currencies** bringing total support to **19 currencies**:\r\n\r\n**Arab Currencies / العملات العربية:**\r\n| Code | Currency |\r\n|------|----------|\r\n| `egp` | Egyptian Pound (جنيه مصري) |\r\n| `syp` | Syrian Pound (جنيه سوري) |\r\n| `lbp` | Lebanese Pound (جنيه لبناني) |\r\n| `iqd` | Iraqi Dinar (دينار عراقي) |\r\n| `jod` | Jordanian Dinar (دينار أردني) |\r\n| `omr` | Omani Rial (ريال عماني) |\r\n| `qar` | Qatari Rial (ريال قطري) |\r\n| `aed` | UAE Dirham (درهم إماراتي) |\r\n| `kwd` | Kuwaiti Dinar (دينار كويتي) |\r\n| `bhd` | Bahraini Dinar (دينار بحريني) |\r\n\r\n**Western Currencies / العملات الغربية:**\r\n| Code | Currency |\r\n|------|----------|\r\n| `eur` | Euro (يورو) |\r\n| `gbp` | British Pound (جنيه إسترليني) |\r\n| `cad` | Canadian Dollar (دولار كندي) |\r\n| `aud` | Australian Dollar (دولار أسترالي) |\r\n| `jpy` | Japanese Yen (ين ياباني) |\r\n| `chf` | Swiss Franc (فرنك سويسري) |\r\n\r\n#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed SDG currency main name: `قرش` → `جنيه` (was incorrectly set to piastre instead of pound)\r\n- Fixed empty fractional currency handling (e.g., JPY has no sub-unit) - no longer appends empty words\r\n\r\n#### 📖 Documentation\r\n- Updated README with comprehensive currency tables grouped by Arab and Western\r\n- Added bilingual currency tables in both English and Arabic READMEs\r\n\r\n### 📋 Full Change List\r\n- Modified: `src/Core/Tafqeet.php` - Expanded CURRENCIES constant (3 → 19 currencies)\r\n- Modified: `src/Core/Tafqeet.php` - Handle empty fractional units gracefully\r\n- Modified: `README.md` - Updated currency tables\r\n- Modified: `README-ar.md` - Updated currency tables\r\n- Added: 13 new currency test cases\r\n\r\n### 💡 Usage Examples\r\n```php\r\n// Egyptian Pound\r\nTafqeet::arablic(1000.50, 'egp');\r\n// Output: فقط ألف جنيه وخمسون قرش لاغير\r\n\r\n// UAE Dirham\r\nTafqeet::arablic(500, 'aed');\r\n// Output: فقط خمسون درهمًا لاغير\r\n\r\n// Euro\r\nTafqeet::arablic(250.75, 'eur');\r\n// Output: فقط مائة وخمسون يوروًا وسبعة وسبعون سنت لاغير\r\n\r\n// British Pound\r\nTafqeet::arablic(100, 'gbp');\r\n// Output: فقط مائة جنيه إسترلينيًا لاغير\r\n\r\n// Japanese Yen (no fractional)\r\nTafqeet::arablic(1000, 'jpy');\r\n// Output: فقط ألف ين لاغير\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 🔧 Technical Details\r\n- Currencies stored as associative array with: `main1`, `main2`, `single`, `multi`\r\n- Empty `single`/`multi` values are skipped in output (e.g., JPY)\r\n- All 17 PHPUnit tests passing ✅\r\n- PSR-12 compliant ✅\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thesmarter/Tafqeet/compare/v2.0...2.1",
      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thesmarter/Tafqeet/tarball/2.1",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thesmarter/Tafqeet/zipball/2.1",
      "assets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 387949192,
      "slug": "thesmarter-tafqeet-v2-0",
      "org": "thesmarter",
      "repo": "Tafqeet",
      "full_name": "thesmarter/Tafqeet",
      "tag_name": "v2.0",
      "name": "Php Tafqeet v2",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/thesmarter/Tafqeet/releases/tag/v2.0",
      "author": {
        "login": "Tayeb-Ali",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9208109?v=4",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/Tayeb-Ali"
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-13T15:44:50Z",
      "published_at": "2026-09-13T15:51:54Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-13T15:51:54Z",
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "### 🎉 What's New in v2\r\n\r\n#### 🔧 Code Rebuild\r\n- Rebuilt the entire library from 5 traits (577 lines) into 1 clean class (384 lines)\r\n- Removed excessive trait architecture (`Validation`, `Handler`, `Digit`, `Calculators`, `App`)\r\n- Improved code maintainability and reduced complexity\r\n\r\n#### ⚡ Performance & Reliability\r\n- Added `declare(strict_types=1)` for strict type checking\r\n- Fixed digit comparison bugs by using `array_map('intval', ...)` (integer arrays instead of strings)\r\n- Replaced `die()` error handling with proper `TafqeetException` custom exception\r\n- Used `match` expressions replacing if/elseif chains for cleaner dispatch\r\n\r\n#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed strict comparison bug in `in_array` for fractional word selection\r\n- Fixed case-sensitivity issue: `src/core` → `src/Core` (PSR-4 compatibility on Linux)\r\n- Fixed `detectClass` returning null for lengths > 6 (now returns null gracefully)\r\n\r\n#### 📦 Packaging\r\n- Updated `composer.json`: added `php: ^8.1` requirement, removed duplicate `minimum-stability`\r\n- Proper PSR-4 autoloading: `thesmarter\\Tafqeet\\` → `src/`\r\n- Added dev dependencies: PHPUnit 10, PHPCS 3\r\n- Added composer scripts: `test`, `cs`, `cs-fix`, `test:ci`\r\n\r\n#### 📖 Documentation\r\n- Complete rewrite of README (English + Arabic)\r\n- Added 6 shields.io badges (Packagist, PHP 8.1+, License, CI, Downloads, GitHub)\r\n- Added Packagist link: https://packagist.org/packages/thesmarter/tafqeet\r\n- Added installation instructions (Composer + manual)\r\n- Added usage examples and currency support table\r\n- Created dedicated `README-ar.md` for Arabic documentation\r\n\r\n#### 🚀 CI/CD\r\n- Added `.github/workflows/ci.yml` - automated testing on push & pull request\r\n- PHP 8.3, composer validate, lint, and tests\r\n\r\n#### 🧪 Testing\r\n- Added comprehensive PHPUnit test suite (11 tests, 100% passing)\r\n- Added `phpunit.xml` configuration\r\n\r\n### 📋 Full Change List\r\n- New file: `src/Core/Tafqeet.php` (rebuilt)\r\n- New file: `src/Exception/TafqeetException.php`\r\n- New file: `tests/TafqeetTest.php` (11 tests)\r\n- New file: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\r\n- New file: `phpunit.xml`\r\n- New file: `README.md` (English)\r\n- New file: `README-ar.md` (Arabic)\r\n- Deleted: `src/helper/App.php`, `src/helper/Calculators.php`, `src/helper/Digit.php`, `src/helper/Handler.php`, `src/helper/Validation.php`\r\n- Deleted: `src/.DS_Store`\r\n- Modified: `composer.json`, `test.php`, `.gitignore`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🏷️ Breaking Changes\r\n- **PHP 8.1+ required** (was unconstrained)\r\n- **Directory renamed**: `src/core/` → `src/Core/` (case-sensitive for Linux compatibility)\r\n- **Error handling**: `die()` → `TafqeetException` (catch exceptions instead of fatal errors)\r\n\r\n### 💡 Migration Guide\r\n```bash\r\n# Update the package\r\ncomposer require thesmarter/tafqeet:^2.0\r\n\r\n# If upgrading from v1, no code changes needed\r\n# The API remains the same:\r\nTafqeet::arablic(3150.9); // Same output\r\n```\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thesmarter/Tafqeet/compare/v1.2...v2.0",
